62
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:23,080
That definitely has to be your top priority.

63
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,400
After you leave,

64
00:06:25,840 --> 00:06:27,320
Lecang's funeral industry

65
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:29,640
