148
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:45,480
A Min.

149
00:11:46,640 --> 00:11:48,040
Thanks for clearing things up for me.

150
00:11:58,520 --> 00:11:59,080
Yiran

151
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:05,760
