152
00:12:21,400 --> 00:12:22,080
Yiran

153
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:23,080
You're back.

154
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,480
Go wash your hands and eat.

155
00:12:26,480 --> 00:12:27,040
Okay.

156
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:32,560
