165
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,960
What's wrong with leftovers?

166
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:57,840
Don't waste it.

167
00:12:59,560 --> 00:13:00,080
Right,

168
00:13:02,760 --> 00:13:05,200
Tang Tang and A Fu asked me to give this to you.

169
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:07,000
