178
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:31,880
It's fine, don't stress over it.

179
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:33,000
Just pick what you like.

180
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:35,000
We'll shoot whichever ones you choose.

181
00:13:37,760 --> 00:13:38,320
Wu!

182
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:40,400
Come here!

183
00:13:40,400 --> 00:13:41,400
Let me introduce you.

184
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:44,520
These two are A Fu and Tang Tang.

185
00:13:45,160 --> 00:13:47,240
Hello, I'm Wu Huilian.

186
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:49,000
I'm happy to help you.

187
00:13:50,520 --> 00:13:52,320
Yeah, she's Huilian.

188
00:13:52,560 --> 00:13:54,320
Yiran's mom.

189
00:13:54,640 --> 00:13:56,000
They know Yiran?

190
00:13:56,920 --> 00:13:59,080
Are you good friends with Yiran?

191
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:00,880
Huilian.

192
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:01,960
You know...

193
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:04,560
If it weren't for Yiran,

194
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:06,640
