195
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:11,640
Everything's fine, why are you crying?

196
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:13,680
Don't cry, don't cry.

197
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:23,440
They're about to take their wedding photos.

198
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:24,840
I'm so happy for them.

199
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:27,000
Yeah.

200
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:27,880
So happy for them.

201
00:14:28,400 --> 00:14:28,960
Here.

202
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:32,640
