203
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:35,320
Come on.

204
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:42,440
Eat up.

205
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:47,680
You working at Joy Bells...

206
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:49,760
Is work going okay?

207
00:14:50,120 --> 00:14:51,160
More than okay.

208
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:53,040
I'm practically the backbone.

209
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,200
You're the backbone?

210
00:14:56,680 --> 00:14:58,880
Why are you giving me that doubting look?

211
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:01,440
I have to tell you all about it.

212
00:15:01,680 --> 00:15:02,920
In all of Lecang,

213
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:05,800
my matchmaking success rate...

214
00:15:06,680 --> 00:15:07,920
If I claim to be second,

215
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:10,240
