216
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:11,680
Plus,

217
00:15:11,680 --> 00:15:14,080
I've got my professional mourning experience, you know.

218
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:16,880
You don't tell people you mourned professionally while matchmaking, do you?

219
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:18,120
Am I dumb?

220
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:19,160
Of course I don't.

221
00:15:19,760 --> 00:15:20,840
What I mean is,

222
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:22,160
whether mourning for others

223
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:24,440
or helping people find a match,

224
00:15:24,920 --> 00:15:25,880
they both require...

225
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:28,080
real emotional investment.

226
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:30,160
Didn't Chen teach me

227
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:33,280
to truly listen, see, and feel?

228
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:35,000
For major life events like these,

229
00:15:35,160 --> 00:15:37,000
I take them very seriously.

230
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:38,880
Okay.

231
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:42,800
Seeing your enthusiasm,

232
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:43,800
I'm relieved.

233
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:47,240
So,

234
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:51,120
Yiran,

235
00:15:52,800 --> 00:15:55,400
when you go to Shanghai,

236
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:57,400
