237
00:15:57,400 --> 00:15:58,720
Make something of yourself.

238
00:15:59,640 --> 00:16:01,760
I believe you can definitely make a name for yourself.

239
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:06,040
You believe I can make a name for myself?

240
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:08,920
Absolutely.

241
00:16:09,880 --> 00:16:11,120
You're pretty,

242
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:12,720
