243
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:14,400
hardworking,

244
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:16,080
and you can endure hardship.

245
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:17,680
If you don't succeed, who will?

246
00:16:18,560 --> 00:16:19,000
Here.

247
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:21,000
Let's drink to that.

248
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:28,920
What are you doing?

249
00:16:35,400 --> 00:16:35,920
Here.

250
00:16:38,800 --> 00:16:39,800
New shoes,

251
00:16:39,800 --> 00:16:40,520
