252
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:57,040
These shoes are so pretty.

253
00:16:57,560 --> 00:16:58,600
Do you want them or not?

254
00:16:58,600 --> 00:16:59,360
If not, I'm returning them.

255
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,680
So stingy!

256
00:17:02,680 --> 00:17:04,520
