257
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:05,480
Just try them on.

258
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:06,840
See if they fit.

259
00:17:07,120 --> 00:17:07,600
Okay.

260
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:20,360
Perfect fit.

261
00:17:20,360 --> 00:17:22,880
I've never worn shoes that fit so well in my life.

262
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:24,120
New shoes,

263
00:17:24,120 --> 00:17:25,480
new path.

264
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:27,000
Stepping toward a new life.

265
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:36,440
Did you notice?

266
00:17:36,760 --> 00:17:38,120
When I wear these shoes,

267
00:17:38,120 --> 00:17:39,880
it makes my butt look a little perkier.

268
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:40,960
I didn't notice.

269
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:42,440
Let me walk a few more laps to show you.

270
00:17:42,840 --> 00:17:44,000
How could you not notice?

271
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:44,600
Look.

272
00:17:45,360 --> 00:17:47,280
Twist, twist, twist.

273
00:17:47,280 --> 00:17:48,360
Twist, twist.

274
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:50,040
Really,

275
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:51,080
these shoes,

276
00:17:51,080 --> 00:17:52,120
I love them so much.

277
00:17:52,120 --> 00:17:53,080
I love them, I love them.

278
00:17:54,360 --> 00:17:55,640
I really, really love them.

279
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:56,840
I love them, I love them!

280
00:17:58,440 --> 00:18:01,040
I love these shoes so much.

281
00:18:01,720 --> 00:18:04,640
I love these shoes, they're so pretty.

282
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:06,640
Don't they look good, Lao Li?

283
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:07,320
Do they look good?

284
00:18:07,320 --> 00:18:08,880
I think they look great.

285
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:09,600
So pretty.

286
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:14,120
Pops,

287
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:16,920
you know what?

288
00:18:19,120 --> 00:18:22,280
I'm living under the same roof with Wu Huilian now.

289
00:18:24,520 --> 00:18:25,960
It seems I'm getting used to it.

290
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:32,280
But I still think about you often.

291
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:40,000
I came to say goodbye to you today.

292
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:43,360
Because tomorrow,

293
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:48,280
I'll be leaving home once again.

294
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:55,640
While I was back, I saw many old friends.

295
00:18:57,040 --> 00:19:00,440
I saw your best friend, Daren.

296
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:01,280
Wait a minute.

297
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:05,320
Huilian.

298
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:08,400
Yiran.

299
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:09,600
Right now,

300
00:19:09,800 --> 00:19:11,640
he runs his own barbecue stand.

301
00:19:12,040 --> 00:19:14,800
But he's just as frugal as before.

302
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:16,480
He earns money but hates spending it.

303
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:18,800
And Juan,

304
00:19:20,080 --> 00:19:21,000
she's also still

305
00:19:21,920 --> 00:19:24,640
running that hair salon with Yangyang.

306
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:28,080
She dresses herself up beautifully every day.

307
00:19:28,520 --> 00:19:30,040
Yangyang has grown up too.

308
00:19:32,040 --> 00:19:33,400
They're doing great.

309
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:42,080
Oh right, Paradise Funeral Home.

310
00:19:43,120 --> 00:19:44,600
Do you remember Paradise Funeral Home?

311
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:53,440
They were the ones who handled your funeral.

312
00:19:58,240 --> 00:20:01,880
The road to the netherworld is long, take it slow;

313
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:04,680
Half awake, half drunk, all sorrows let go.

314
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:05,720
Pops,

315
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:08,000
you must bless Chen from heaven.

316
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:09,080
Bless him with

317
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:11,440
good health and a long life.

318
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:15,680
Also, there's a weirdo at Paradise Funeral Home.

319
00:20:15,680 --> 00:20:16,680
His name is A Min.

320
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:19,320
He doesn't like to smile,

321
00:20:19,320 --> 00:20:20,440
and doesn't talk much either.

322
00:20:20,440 --> 00:20:22,480
He scared me when I first saw him.

323
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:25,520
I thought, why does he look like a bad guy?

324
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:28,120
But he's actually very nice.

325
00:20:29,600 --> 00:20:31,320
And he gave me a lot of inspiration.

326
00:20:32,240 --> 00:20:33,800
A person truly dies

327
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:36,640
when they are forgotten by the living.

328
00:20:38,360 --> 00:20:39,960
Chen's daughter, Xiaofang,

329
00:20:40,720 --> 00:20:43,160
she's my best, best, best friend.

330
00:20:44,440 --> 00:20:46,480
You must bless her with happiness.

331
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:49,760
Bless her with lots and lots of happiness.

332
00:20:49,960 --> 00:20:53,360
Bless me, Chen Xiaofang, to become a multimillionaire soon!

333
00:20:53,560 --> 00:20:55,000
She has a dream

334
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:56,720
of becoming a rich young lady.

335
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:58,680
If possible,

336
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:01,880
just bless her with sudden wealth too.

337
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:10,360
And Xiaofang's brother,

338
00:21:11,840 --> 00:21:12,760
Chen Baixi.

339
00:21:13,800 --> 00:21:19,120
He chose to come back from Beijing.

340
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:20,040
After not seeing him for years,

341
00:21:20,040 --> 00:21:22,240
I feel like he's changed.

342
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:25,720
Yet it also seems like nothing has changed.

343
00:21:27,360 --> 00:21:29,200
I feel like he's another version of me.

344
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:30,800
Don't try to persuade me.

345
00:21:31,360 --> 00:21:32,400
Everyone has their own ambitions.

346
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:34,280
Everyone has their own path to walk.

347
00:21:34,320 --> 00:21:35,800
Actually, when it comes down to it,

348
00:21:35,800 --> 00:21:37,480
the one I worry about the most

349
00:21:40,680 --> 00:21:42,120
is still Wu Huilian.

350
00:21:46,440 --> 00:21:48,280
I know, I know.

351
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:52,560
I know what you'd say to me if you were here.

352
00:21:52,560 --> 00:21:54,040
You'd definitely try to persuade me again,

353
00:21:54,520 --> 00:21:56,120
saying she's doing it all for my own good.

354
00:21:58,640 --> 00:21:59,920
I understand all of that.

355
00:22:05,120 --> 00:22:06,280
But Pops,

356
00:22:12,560 --> 00:22:15,400
I just haven't figured out how to forgive her yet.

357
00:22:21,720 --> 00:22:23,320
I miss you so much.

358
00:22:32,400 --> 00:22:33,760
I really miss you.

359
00:22:41,840 --> 00:22:42,640
Lao Li.

360
00:22:43,560 --> 00:22:45,080
Yiran and I are doing fine.

361
00:22:46,040 --> 00:22:47,680
I have a new job.

362
00:22:48,400 --> 00:22:50,400
I'm working at that matchmaking company.

363
00:22:50,840 --> 00:22:52,160
It's very stable.

364
00:22:53,640 --> 00:22:54,520
As for Yiran,

365
00:22:55,000 --> 00:22:56,680
she got a new job too.

366
00:22:57,560 --> 00:22:58,880
She's going to Shanghai.

367
00:23:00,760 --> 00:23:02,080
She leaves tomorrow.

368
00:23:02,760 --> 00:23:03,880
Actually, right now,

369
00:23:05,440 --> 00:23:06,680
I'm very content.

370
00:23:08,160 --> 00:23:09,760
I just have a little regret.

371
00:23:11,560 --> 00:23:12,920
She won't call me Mom.

372
00:23:14,880 --> 00:23:16,160
But that's okay.

373
00:23:18,360 --> 00:23:19,560
The two of us

374
00:23:19,560 --> 00:23:21,400
never speak nicely to each other.

375
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:23,280
I say one thing, she talks back.

376
00:23:24,240 --> 00:23:25,160
But it's good in a way.

377
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:27,720
All the bickering

378
00:23:27,720 --> 00:23:30,400
makes this house feel alive, right?

379
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:33,560
Otherwise, without you, it's so empty.

380
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:37,240
Come on, Lao Li.

381
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:39,160
Let's have a little drink.

382
00:23:44,720 --> 00:23:47,120
Yiran has had a hard life.

383
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:49,520
Watch over her from heaven.

384
00:23:50,040 --> 00:23:52,560
As long as she's safe

385
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:55,240
and healthy, that's enough.

386
00:23:56,880 --> 00:23:57,680
Cheers.

387
00:24:01,960 --> 00:24:02,840
Wu Huilian.

388
00:24:03,720 --> 00:24:05,000
You're drunk again.

389
00:24:06,520 --> 00:24:07,680
Let's go to bed.

390
00:24:13,880 --> 00:24:14,720
Stay a bit.

391
00:24:17,400 --> 00:24:18,560
Just sit with me for a bit.

392
00:24:41,360 --> 00:24:42,160
Yiran,

393
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:43,400
I know

394
00:24:43,720 --> 00:24:45,040
deep down,

395
00:24:47,560 --> 00:24:48,720
you still hate me.

396
00:24:50,400 --> 00:24:51,480
So,

397
00:24:51,480 --> 00:24:54,200
you never call me Mom.

398
00:24:56,280 --> 00:24:57,320
But that's okay.

399
00:24:58,840 --> 00:25:00,000
You calling me Wu Huilian...

400
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:03,040
I like hearing that, too.

401
00:25:04,000 --> 00:25:05,480
You can call me whatever you want.

402
00:25:12,400 --> 00:25:13,560
It's been so many years,

403
00:25:14,880 --> 00:25:17,800
and I've never properly told you

404
00:25:23,120 --> 00:25:23,920
I'm sorry.

405
00:25:29,080 --> 00:25:30,640
About what happened eight years ago,

406
00:25:31,040 --> 00:25:32,360
I never expected

407
00:25:36,360 --> 00:25:37,800
things to end up like this.

408
00:25:38,880 --> 00:25:39,920
Stop pretending!

409
00:25:40,120 --> 00:25:41,120
Stop pretending!

410
00:25:42,600 --> 00:25:43,680
You don't like drinking, huh?

411
00:25:43,680 --> 00:25:44,840
Come on! Come on!

412
00:25:44,840 --> 00:25:45,640
Drink up!

413
00:25:45,640 --> 00:25:46,320
Just drink!

414
00:25:46,320 --> 00:25:47,200
You sure you don't like it?

415
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:49,160
Drink!

416
00:25:50,080 --> 00:25:51,240
Son of a bitch, that's way out of line!

417
00:25:51,240 --> 00:25:52,880
Mom, Mom, calm down.

418
00:25:52,880 --> 00:25:54,400
Let's call the cops and wait for them.

419
00:25:54,760 --> 00:25:56,640
By the time they arrive, she'll be bullied to death!

420
00:25:57,080 --> 00:25:57,800
Stay out of this.

421
00:25:58,400 --> 00:25:59,240
What are you doing?

422
00:25:59,720 --> 00:26:01,000
What are you doing, son of a bitch?

423
00:26:02,000 --> 00:26:02,880
You filthy men,

424
00:26:02,880 --> 00:26:04,520
why are you bullying a girl?

425
00:26:05,680 --> 00:26:07,320
Stupid bitch, sticking your nose in?

426
00:26:08,080 --> 00:26:08,840
What are you doing?

427
00:26:08,840 --> 00:26:09,680
What do you want?

428
00:26:09,960 --> 00:26:11,520
If you keep bullying her, I'll call the cops!

429
00:26:12,160 --> 00:26:13,040
Call the cops my ass!

430
00:26:13,600 --> 00:26:14,760
She likes to drink!

431
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:15,840
Come on, drink!

432
00:26:20,520 --> 00:26:21,840
Son of a bitch! What are you doing?

433
00:26:21,840 --> 00:26:22,760
Let her go!

434
00:26:23,960 --> 00:26:25,320
Mom! Mom!

435
00:26:25,320 --> 00:26:26,000
Are you okay?

436
00:26:26,440 --> 00:26:27,200
Pull her away!

437
00:26:39,120 --> 00:26:40,120
Get away!

438
00:26:42,720 --> 00:26:43,720
Son of a bitch!

439
00:26:47,800 --> 00:26:50,480
Son of a bitch! How dare you hit my wife!

440
00:26:50,600 --> 00:26:52,560
And hit my daughter!

441
00:26:52,560 --> 00:26:53,640
I'll kill you!

442
00:26:53,640 --> 00:26:54,480
Hit him!

443
00:26:55,360 --> 00:26:56,280
Get out of the way!

444
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:57,640
What are you doing?!

445
00:26:58,160 --> 00:26:59,000
Get away!

446
00:27:01,560 --> 00:27:02,400
You're asking for it!

447
00:27:03,640 --> 00:27:04,480
I'll kill you!

448
00:27:07,160 --> 00:27:09,080
Pops! Pops! Pops!

449
00:27:12,880 --> 00:27:13,720
Yiran!

450
00:27:14,240 --> 00:27:14,880
Yiran!

451
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:20,040
Yiran!

452
00:27:20,680 --> 00:27:21,520
Yiran!

453
00:27:21,760 --> 00:27:22,600
Yiran!

454
00:27:25,320 --> 00:27:26,040
Lao Li!

455
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:28,960
Son of a bitch!

456
00:27:42,680 --> 00:27:43,720
Son of a bitch

457
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:54,280
Pops

458
00:27:56,760 --> 00:27:57,640
Lao Li

459
00:27:59,760 --> 00:28:00,600
Lao Li

460
00:28:05,840 --> 00:28:06,680
Lao Li

461
00:28:12,600 --> 00:28:13,640
Lao Li

462
00:28:13,640 --> 00:28:14,480
Lao Li

463
00:28:14,480 --> 00:28:15,440
Lao Li

464
00:28:15,440 --> 00:28:16,720
Lao Li

465
00:28:18,880 --> 00:28:20,560
When I saw that girl

466
00:28:21,440 --> 00:28:23,240
getting bullied by a bunch of guys,

467
00:28:25,600 --> 00:28:27,600
I felt like if I didn't help her,

468
00:28:30,080 --> 00:28:31,480
it would just break my heart.

469
00:28:33,320 --> 00:28:34,520
She was so young.

470
00:28:35,400 --> 00:28:37,520
So, I...

471
00:28:53,440 --> 00:28:54,080
Yiran,

472
00:28:54,080 --> 00:28:55,960
Mom is so sorry.

473
00:29:32,960 --> 00:29:33,640
Lao Li, look.

474
00:29:37,560 --> 00:29:38,360
Go to sleep.

475
00:29:48,880 --> 00:29:49,680
Time for bed.

476
00:29:51,200 --> 00:29:52,000
Let's go.

477
00:29:53,440 --> 00:29:54,600
I'll take you to bed.

478
00:30:09,320 --> 00:30:10,040
Go to sleep.

479
00:30:47,960 --> 00:30:48,880
Damn it

480
00:30:54,320 --> 00:30:55,960
I drank too much again last night.

481
00:31:27,160 --> 00:31:28,240
Take all of these with you.

482
00:31:28,240 --> 00:31:29,440
I made them myself.

483
00:31:29,560 --> 00:31:30,640
Why so much?

484
00:31:31,680 --> 00:31:32,360
Look.

485
00:31:32,360 --> 00:31:33,080
This

486
00:31:33,080 --> 00:31:35,040
is your favorite dried radish.

487
00:31:35,480 --> 00:31:36,160
And this.

488
00:31:36,160 --> 00:31:38,040
Pickled chili bamboo shoots. Great with rice.

489
00:31:38,280 --> 00:31:40,080
And the hotpot base I made for you.

490
00:31:40,080 --> 00:31:42,520
The food in Shanghai is too sweet.

491
00:31:42,520 --> 00:31:43,440
It won't suit your taste.

492
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:03,720
Did I drink too much again last night?

493
00:32:10,800 --> 00:32:11,720
Hey, Xiaofang.

494
00:32:11,720 --> 00:32:13,600
Yiran, hurry to Paradise Funeral Home.

495
00:32:13,600 --> 00:32:14,280
It's urgent.

496
00:32:14,280 --> 00:32:15,080
What's going on?

497
00:32:15,080 --> 00:32:16,280
You'll see when you get here.

498
00:32:16,280 --> 00:32:16,920
Okay.

499
00:32:16,920 --> 00:32:17,760
Wu Huilian, I'm not eating!

500
00:32:17,760 --> 00:32:18,600
I'm heading out!

501
00:32:19,360 --> 00:32:20,120
Wait!

502
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:22,840
Grab something to eat on the way.

503
00:32:22,840 --> 00:32:24,080
Don't go hungry!

504
00:32:24,600 --> 00:32:25,720
Got it!

505
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:26,440
Slow down!

506
00:33:09,760 --> 00:33:11,640
Sorry for always bothering you.

507
00:33:11,880 --> 00:33:13,000
It's no trouble at all.

508
00:33:13,200 --> 00:33:14,520
Once it's fixed, we won't be in the dark.

509
00:33:14,520 --> 00:33:14,960
Yeah, exactly.

510
00:33:14,960 --> 00:33:16,160
Careful, Daren.

511
00:33:16,160 --> 00:33:16,640
Yiran.

512
00:33:16,640 --> 00:33:17,360
Director Ma.

513
00:33:17,360 --> 00:33:18,280
You guys be careful.

514
00:33:18,280 --> 00:33:19,440
Will do, will do.

515
00:33:25,440 --> 00:33:26,240
Mom!

516
00:33:27,520 --> 00:33:28,640
Xiaojie, Xiaoran.

517
00:33:29,680 --> 00:33:30,640
Stop it, stop it.

518
00:33:31,320 --> 00:33:32,080
You little brat!

519
00:33:32,080 --> 00:33:33,160
I just did my makeup!

520
00:33:33,160 --> 00:33:34,240
Morning, Juan.

521
00:33:34,240 --> 00:33:34,920
Heading out?

522
00:33:34,920 --> 00:33:35,760
Just running some errands.

523
00:33:38,000 --> 00:33:40,080
Yangyang, careful with your hands.

524
00:33:40,440 --> 00:33:42,400
Getting medicine for your aunt again?

525
00:33:42,800 --> 00:33:44,120
Got a lot this time.

526
00:33:44,440 --> 00:33:45,280
Come with me.

527
00:33:45,280 --> 00:33:46,280
I just made some ice jelly.

528
00:33:46,280 --> 00:33:47,560
Take a bowl for her to try.

529
00:33:47,560 --> 00:33:48,480
I'm always bothering you.

530
00:34:05,680 --> 00:34:06,480
Yiran.

531
00:34:09,040 --> 00:34:11,240
I... I'd like to say a few more words to Yiran.

532
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:14,160
Yiran,

533
00:34:14,760 --> 00:34:15,840
I, A Min,

534
00:34:16,320 --> 00:34:17,880
am a dozen years older than you.

535
00:34:19,080 --> 00:34:22,240
I don't know if what I'm saying is right.

536
00:34:24,640 --> 00:34:26,080
Living in this world,

537
00:34:26,520 --> 00:34:30,720
frankly, is just about experiencing things.

538
00:34:30,760 --> 00:34:31,520
Not everyone

539
00:34:31,520 --> 00:34:34,720
has to become what others consider successful.

540
00:34:35,400 --> 00:34:38,400
In life, there are mountains you can't cross,

541
00:34:38,920 --> 00:34:39,680
rivers you can't ford,

542
00:34:39,680 --> 00:34:40,760
and distant places you can't reach.

543
00:34:44,640 --> 00:34:45,560
But sometimes,

544
00:34:46,360 --> 00:34:47,480
standing at the foot of a mountain,

545
00:34:48,360 --> 00:34:49,560
watching the sun climb over the peak,

546
00:34:50,600 --> 00:34:51,960
isn't that also a form of rising?

547
00:34:53,600 --> 00:34:56,520
Watching the river flow by so quietly,

548
00:34:57,120 --> 00:34:58,560
isn't that also a beautiful view?

549
00:35:01,880 --> 00:35:02,960
No matter how great that distant place is,

550
00:35:05,200 --> 00:35:06,280
if your family isn't there,

551
00:35:07,400 --> 00:35:08,320
then it isn't home.

552
00:35:10,640 --> 00:35:11,680
As for me, A Min,

553
00:35:12,320 --> 00:35:14,160
I've been in this industry for over a decade.

554
00:35:14,600 --> 00:35:15,920
My biggest realization is that

555
00:35:17,920 --> 00:35:19,640
people are just like plants.

556
00:35:21,640 --> 00:35:22,640
If they have no roots,

557
00:35:24,360 --> 00:35:25,640
they are destined to drift.

558
00:35:28,280 --> 00:35:29,080
So, Yiran,

559
00:35:29,680 --> 00:35:30,800
sometimes in life,

560
00:35:31,400 --> 00:35:33,400
you can't always just make the right choices.

561
00:35:34,640 --> 00:35:37,440
You can also make choices you simply like.

562
00:35:44,480 --> 00:35:45,320
A Min,

563
00:35:47,480 --> 00:35:49,240
you usually don't say much.

564
00:35:50,360 --> 00:35:51,520
But you've said so much today.

565
00:35:53,760 --> 00:35:54,560
Thank you.

566
00:35:55,520 --> 00:35:56,440
I'll remember this.

567
00:36:35,520 --> 00:36:36,400
What are you doing standing here?

568
00:36:36,400 --> 00:36:37,440
Where are you going? I'll give you a ride.

569
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:38,800
Paradise Funeral Home.

570
00:36:39,280 --> 00:36:39,880
Let's go that way.

571
00:36:39,880 --> 00:36:40,400
Let's go.

572
00:36:50,760 --> 00:36:51,320
They're coming!

573
00:36:51,320 --> 00:36:52,000
Run!

574
00:36:52,520 --> 00:36:53,320
Stop!

575
00:36:54,680 --> 00:36:55,360
Stop running!

576
00:36:56,160 --> 00:36:56,960
Freeze!

577
00:36:58,640 --> 00:37:00,360
If you want to go back to Shanghai,

578
00:37:00,600 --> 00:37:01,200
then go.

579
00:37:02,360 --> 00:37:03,560
This tiny place

580
00:37:04,040 --> 00:37:05,560
can't hold someone with dreams.

581
00:37:08,040 --> 00:37:09,280
What about you, Chen Baixi?

582
00:37:10,800 --> 00:37:12,640
Have you learned

583
00:37:12,640 --> 00:37:14,640
to make peace with this world?

584
00:37:16,080 --> 00:37:17,440
Didn't I already tell you?

585
00:37:17,760 --> 00:37:19,200
I've already been left behind.

586
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:20,560
I'm done fighting.

587
00:37:20,560 --> 00:37:21,520
I'm lying flat.

588
00:37:45,680 --> 00:37:46,560
It's raining so hard.

589
00:37:46,560 --> 00:37:47,960
What are you doing standing outside?

590
00:37:47,960 --> 00:37:48,960
Are you out of your mind?

591
00:37:51,960 --> 00:37:53,000
None of your business.

592
00:38:09,600 --> 00:38:11,000
Come on, cheer up.

593
00:38:14,480 --> 00:38:15,280
Watch out!

594
00:38:33,160 --> 00:38:34,280
The seatbelt's broken.

595
00:38:34,280 --> 00:38:35,360
I was afraid you couldn't buckle it.

596
00:38:35,360 --> 00:38:36,160
Let me help you fasten it.

597
00:39:05,480 --> 00:39:06,400
What are you grinning at?

598
00:39:10,040 --> 00:39:10,880
Was I grinning?

599
00:39:11,840 --> 00:39:12,760
You were.

600
00:39:25,240 --> 00:39:25,960
Let's go!

601
00:39:27,040 --> 00:39:28,200
You're taking forever.
